
  Specify additional netsim arguments to pass to netsim instance.

  Separates arguments by space if there are multiple flags. Valid examples are:
    --pcap
    "--pcap --hci-port 12345"
    "--pcap --hci-port=12345"

  Run `netsimd --help` to list all the avaiable flags.
  The netsimd binary should be located at the same folder as the emulator binary.


